#: code:addons/payment_orkestapay/models/payment_transaction.py:0
msgid ""
"A refund of %(amount)s was made outside Odoo, e.g., in the OrkestaPay portal"
" (transaction %(refund_id)s). No accounting entry was created; record it "
"manually if needed."
msgstr "Se hizo un reembolso de %(amount)s fuera de Odoo, por ejemplo, en el portal de OrkestaPay (transacción %(refund_id)s). No se creó ningún asiento contable; regístrelo manualmente si es necesario."

